          "code": "DISPLAY_NEGOTIATIONS_WORKLIST",
          "id": "1765215777350",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1765215777351_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "# ROLE\nYou are a UI Data Mapper. Your goal is to generate a JSON configuration for a \"multiRecordWidget\" by mapping input data to specific display rows.\n\n# INPUT DATA\nGlobal Settings:\n- Language: {{$context.$variables.Language}}\n- Currency: {{$context.$variables.Currency}} (Not used for counts, but kept for context)\n\nData Sources:\n- Total Counts List: {{$context.$nodes.CALCULATE_NEGOTIATIONS_COUNT.$output.result.items}} (Contains objects with 'Status' and 'Count')\n- Needing Attention Count List: {{$context.$nodes.ANALIZE_ALL_NEGOTIATIONS.$output.output}} \n\n\n# WIDGET CONFIGURATION\n**Title:** Translate \"Overview\" into {{Language}}.\n\n**Columns:**\n1. \"Negotiation Status\" (Label)\n2. \"Count\" (Yellow Badge)\n3. \"Needing Attention\" (Red Badge)\n\n# ROW GENERATION LOGIC\nCreate exactly 4 records (rows) in the following order. For each row, calculate the data as follows:\n\n1. **Row: Active**\n   - Status Label: Translate \"Active\" into {{Language}}.\n   - Count: Search 'Total Counts List' for an item where Status is \"Active\". If found, use its count. If not found, use 0.\n   - Attention: Use count value coming in Needing Attention Count list for  IN_PROGRESS bucket. If found, use its count. If not found, use 0.\n\n2. **Row: Opening Soon**\n   - Status Label: Translate \"Opening Soon\" into {{Language}}.\n   - Count: Search 'Total Counts List' for an item where Status is \"Opening Soon\". If found, use its count. If not found, use 0.\n   - Attention: Set to 0 (No input provided).\n\n3. **Row: Draft**\n   - Status Label: Translate \"Draft\" into {{Language}}.\n   - Count: Search 'Total Counts List' for an item where Status is \"Draft\". If found, use its count. If not found, use 0.\n   - Attention:  Use count value coming in Needing Attention Count list for BEFORE_PUBLISH bucket. If found, use its count. If not found, use 0.\n\n4. **Row: Pending Award**\n   - Status Label: Translate \"Pending Award\" into {{Language}}.\n   - Count: Search 'Total Counts List' for an item where Status is \"Pending Award\". If found, use its count. If not found, use 0.\n   - Attention:  Use count value coming in Needing Attention Count list for BEFORE_END bucket. If found, use its count. If not found, use 0.\n\n\n# OUTPUT FORMAT\nReturn ONLY valid JSON with this structure:\n{\n   \"title\":\"Overview\",\n   \"patternId\":\"multiRecordWidget\",\n   \"properties\":{\n      \"subtitle\":\"Status summary\",\n      \"cols\":[\n         \"Negotiation Status\",\n         \"Count\",\n         \"Needing Attention\"\n      ],\n      \"rows\":[\n         {\n            \"cells\":[\n               \"<Translated Status>\",\n               {\n                  \"type\":\"badge\",\n                  \"text\":\"<totalCount>\",\n                  \"priority\":\"medium\"\n               },\n               {\n                  \"type\":\"badge\",\n                  \"text\":\"<needingAttentionCount>\",\n                  \"priority\":\"alert\"\n               }\n            ]\n         },\n          ... (repeat for all 4 rows)\n      ]\n   }\n}"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Calculate Negotiations Count",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "const buckets =  $context.$nodes.GET_NEGOTIATIONS_COUNT.$output.aggregations.orderForCurrentNegotiationStatusCode.buckets;\n\nlet active= 0;\nlet draft = 0;\nlet openingSoon = 0;\nlet pendingAward = 0;\n\n\nfor (const bucket of buckets) {\n   if(bucket.key==\"ACTIVE\"){\n      active = active+bucket.doc_count;\n   }else if(bucket.key==\"SUBMITTED\" || bucket.key==\"PREVIEW\"){\n      openingSoon  = openingSoon +bucket.doc_count;\n   }else if(bucket.key==\"DRAFT\" || bucket.key==\"REJECTED\" || bucket.key==\"WITHDRAWN\" || bucket.key==\"APPROVAL_IN_PROCESS\"){\n       draft  = draft +bucket.doc_count;\n   }else if(bucket.key==\"CLOSED\" || bucket.key==\"AWARD_APPROVAL_INPROCESS\" || bucket.key==\"AWARD_IN_PROG\" || bucket.key==\"AWARD_REJECTED\" || bucket.key==\"AWARD_APPROVED\" || bucket.key==\"AWARD_APPROVAL_WITHDRAWN\"){\n       pendingAward = pendingAward +bucket.doc_count;\n   }\n}\n\nactive = active + $context.$nodes.GET_TOTAL_PAUSED_NEGOTIATIONS.$output.totalResults;\n\nlet statusCountsObj = {\n  items: [\n    { status: \"Active\",  count: active },\n    { status: \"Opening Soon\",  count: openingSoon },\n    { status: \"Draft\",  count: draft },\n    { status: \"Pending Award\", count: pendingAward }\n  ]\n};\n\nreturn statusCountsObj ;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1765215777350"
          },
          "code": "CALCULATE_NEGOTIATIONS_COUNT",
          "id": "1768434063603",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"required\": [\n    \"result\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
