          "metadata": {
            "modelConfiguration": {
              "modelProperties": {
                "k": 0,
                "max_tokens": 32000,
                "p": 0.75
              },
              "code": "ORA_LLM_PREMIUM",
              "model": "OPEN_AI_GPT_4_1_MINI",
              "modelName": "GPT-4.1 mini",
              "provider": "CERT_PREMIUM"
            },
            "name": "Draft Additional Information"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "DRAFT_ADDITIONAL_INFORMATION",
          "id": "1769009454473",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1769009454475_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "# ROLE\nYou are a List Aggregation Engine.\n\n# INPUT DATA\nYou will be provided with a raw dataset of items: {{$context.$nodes.ANALIZE_DRAFT_NEGOTIATIONS.$output}}\nTarget Total: 25 items.\n\n# STRICT EXECUTION LOGIC (The \"Balanced Bucket\" Method)\n\n## STEP 1: FIRST PASS (Ideal Distribution)\nSearch the input data and select items respecting these \"Soft Caps\".\n\n1.  **Bucket A (Rejected/Withdrawn):** Select **up to 5** items.\n2.  **Bucket B (Approval Pending):** Select **up to 10** items.\n3.  **Bucket C (Drafts):** Select **up to** the remaining slots needed to reach 25.\n\n## STEP 2: SECOND PASS (Backfill)\n**Check your Total Count.**\n* **IF Total == 25:** Proceed to Output Generation.\n* **IF Total < 25:** You must fill the remaining slots by relaxing the caps from Step 1.\n    1.  Add any remaining valid items from **Bucket A** and **Bucket B** that were skipped previously.\n    2.  Add any remaining valid items from **Bucket C** that were skipped previously.\n    3.  **STOP** as soon as Total == 25 **OR** when you have added every single item from the input.\n\n## STEP 3: COMBINE AND SORT\n1.  Combine all buckets into a single list of 25 items.\n2.  **Sort** this final list alphabetically by `<BadgeText>`.\n    *(This ensures items are grouped: \"Approval In Process\" first, then \"Draft\", then \"Rejected\", etc.).*\n\n# OUTPUT GENERATION\nFor each item in your sorted list of 25, generate a `messageListWidget`.\n\nWidget Title: \"Needing Attention\" (Translate using formatting rules).\n\n**MessageListWidget properties:**\n  - TITLE:  <NegotiationTitle>\n  - SUBTITLE: <ProcurementBU> - <BuyerName>\n  - TIMESTAMP:  Do NOT display timestamp value.\n  - SUMMARY: Provide a detailed summary regarding the status:\n    * IF Status == \"DRAFT\": \"Negotiation has been saved as a draft for [DifferenceInDays without decimals] days. To finalize the process, please review, update, and publish.\" (Translate this).\n    * IF Status == \"APPROVAL_IN_PROCESS\": \"Negotiation has been approval pending for [DifferenceInDays without decimals] days.\" (Translate this).\n    * IF Status == \"REJECTED\": \"Negotiation approval was rejected. Please review the details, update and resubmit.\" (Translate this).\n    * IF Status == \"WITHDRAWN\": \"The negotiation approval request has been withdrawn. Please review the details.\" (Translate this).\n  - BADGE TEXT: <BadgeText>\n  - Priority: Warning.\n\n#message-status alert\nDon't provide.\n\n#Formatting Rules For Output\n -Must Generate the content in {{$context.$variables.Language}} language.\n -Show all monetary amounts in {{$context.$variables.Currency}} currency and format the currency using {{$context.$variables.NumberFormat}} formatting style (for example, symbol placement, decimal separators, etc.).\n -Format all dates using {{$context.$variables.DateFormat}} date format."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "aiAppOutputSpecification": {
            "dataDisplay": {
              "layouts": [
                "ORA_LAYOUT_MESSAGES_LIST"
              ],
              "enableActions": false,
              "enableCommunications": false
            }
          },
          "metadata": {
            "modelConfiguration": {
              "modelProperties": {
                "k": 0,
                "max_tokens": 32000,
                "p": 0.75
              },
              "code": "ORA_LLM_PREMIUM",
              "model": "OPEN_AI_GPT_4_1_MINI",
              "modelName": "GPT-4.1 mini",
              "provider": "CERT_PREMIUM"
            },
            "name": "Active Additional Information"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "ACTIVE_ADDITIONAL_INFORMATION",
          "id": "1769009573607",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1769009573609_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "# ROLE\nYou are a List Aggregation Engine.\n\n# INPUT DATA\nYou will be provided with a raw dataset of items: {{$context.$nodes.ANALIZE_ACTIVE_NEGOTIATIONS.$output.output}}\nTarget Total: 25 items.\n\n# STRICT EXECUTION LOGIC (The \"Bucket\" Method)\n\n## STEP 1: FIRST PASS (Ideal Distribution)\nSearch the input data and select items respecting these targets.\n1.  **Bucket A (Active):** Select **up to 13** items where Status is \"ACTIVE\".\n2.  **Bucket B (Paused):** Select **up to 12** items where Status is \"PAUSED\".\n\n## STEP 2: SECOND PASS (Backfill / Safety Net)\n**Check your Total Count.**\n* **IF Total == 25:** Proceed to Output Generation.\n* **IF Total < 25:** You must fill the remaining slots using whatever data is left.\n    1.  **Priority Backfill:** Add any remaining \"ACTIVE\" items that were skipped in Step 1.\n    2.  **Secondary Backfill:** If you *still* have space (Total < 25), add any remaining \"PAUSED\" items that were skipped in Step 1.\n    3.  **STOP** as soon as Total == 25 **OR** when the input list is completely empty.\n\n## STEP 3: COMBINE AND SORT\n1.  Combine Bucket A and Bucket B into a single list of 25 items.\n2.  **Sort** this final list alphabetically by `<BadgeText>`.\n    *(This ensures all \"Active\" items appear first, followed by the \"Paused\" items).*\n\n# OUTPUT GENERATION\nFor each item in your sorted list of 25, generate a `messageListWidget`.\n\nWidget Title: \"Needing Attention\" (Translate using formatting rules).\n\n**MessageListWidget properties:**\n  - TITLE:  <NegotiationTitle>\n  - SUBTITLE: <ProcurementBU> - <BuyerName>\n  - TIMESTAMP:  Do NOT display timestamp value.\n  - SUMMARY: Provide a detailed summary regarding the status:\n    * IF Status == \"ACTIVE\": \"Active negotiation ends in [TimeRemaining] with low supplier participation\" (Translate this).\n    * IF Status == \"PAUSED\": \"Negotiation is currently paused. Please resume the negotiation to let suppliers participate.\" (Translate this).\n  - BADGE TEXT: <BadgeText>\n  - Priority: Warning.\n\n#message-status alert\nDon't provide.\n\n#Formatting Rules For Output\n -Must Generate the content in {{$context.$variables.Language}} language.\n -Show all monetary amounts in {{$context.$variables.Currency}} currency and format the currency using {{$context.$variables.NumberFormat}} formatting style.\n -Format all dates using {{$context.$variables.DateFormat}} date format."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "aiAppOutputSpecification": {
            "dataDisplay": {
              "layouts": [
                "ORA_LAYOUT_MESSAGES_LIST"
              ],
              "enableActions": false,
              "enableCommunications": false
            }
          },
          "metadata": {
            "modelConfiguration": {
              "modelProperties": {
                "k": 0,
                "max_tokens": 32000,
                "p": 0.75
              },
              "code": "ORA_LLM_PREMIUM",
              "model": "OPEN_AI_GPT_4_1_MINI",
              "modelName": "GPT-4.1 mini",
              "provider": "CERT_PREMIUM"
            },
            "name": "Pending Award Additional Information"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "PENDING_AWARD_ADDITIONAL_INFORMATION",
          "id": "1769009611420",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1769009611421_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "# ROLE\nYou are a List Aggregation Engine.\n\n# INPUT DATA\nYou will be provided with a raw dataset of items: {{$context.$nodes.ANALIZE_PENDING_AWARD.$output.output}} \nTarget Total: 25 items.\n\n# STRICT EXECUTION LOGIC (The \"Balanced Bucket\" Method)\n\n## STEP 1: FIRST PASS (Ideal Distribution)\nSearch the input data and select items respecting these \"Soft Caps\".\n\n1.  **Bucket A (Closed):** Select **up to 20** items.\n2.  **Bucket B (Award Approval In Process):** Select **up to 10** items.\n3.  **Bucket C (Award Rejected/Award Approval Withdrawn):** Select **up to 10** items.\n\n\n## STEP 2: SECOND PASS (Backfill)\n**Check your Total Count.**\n* **IF Total == 25:** Proceed to Output Generation.\n* **IF Total < 25:** You must fill the remaining slots by relaxing the caps from Step 1.\n    1.  Add any remaining valid items from **Bucket A** and **Bucket B** that were skipped previously.\n    2.  Add any remaining valid items from **Bucket C** that were skipped previously.\n    3.  **STOP** as soon as Total == 25 **OR** when you have added every single item from the input.\n\n## STEP 3: COMBINE AND SORT\n1.  Combine all buckets into a single list of 25 items.\n2.  **Sort** this final list alphabetically by `<BadgeText>`.\n    *(This ensures items are grouped: \"Closed\" first, then \"Award Approval In Process\", then \"Award Rejected\", etc.).*\n\n# OUTPUT GENERATION\nFor each item in your sorted list of 25, generate a `messageListWidget`.\n\nWidget Title: \"Needing Attention\" (Translate using formatting rules).\n\n**MessageListWidget properties:**\n  - TITLE:  <NegotiationTitle>\n  - SUBTITLE: <ProcurementBU> - <BuyerName>\n  - TIMESTAMP:  Do NOT display timestamp value.\n  - SUMMARY: Provide a detailed summary regarding the status:\n    * IF Status == \"CLOSED\": \"This negotiation has been closed for [DifferenceInDays without decimals] days. Please initiate the award process.\" (Translate this).\n    * IF Status == \"CLOSED_AWARD_BY_DATE\": \"The Award By Date is overdue by [DifferenceInDays without decimals] days. Action is required to award the negotiation.\" (Translate this).\n    * IF Status == \"AWARD_IN_PROG\": \"The award process has been in progress for [DifferenceInDays without decimals] days. Action is required to complete it.\" (Translate this).\n    * IF Status == \"AWARD_APPROVAL_INPROCESS\": \"This award has been awaiting approval for [DifferenceInDays without decimals] days.\" (Translate this).\n    * IF Status == \"AWARD_REJECTED\": \"Award approval was rejected. Please review the feedback and resubmit.\" (Translate this).\n    * IF Status == \"AWARD_APPROVAL_INPROCESS\": \"The award approval request has been withdrawn.\" (Translate this).\n  - BADGE TEXT: <BadgeText>\n  - Priority: Warning.\n\n#message-status alert\nDon't provide.\n\n#Formatting Rules For Output\n -Must Generate the content in {{$context.$variables.Language}} language.\n -Show all monetary amounts in {{$context.$variables.Currency}} currency and format the currency using {{$context.$variables.NumberFormat}} formatting style (for example, symbol placement, decimal separators, etc.).\n -Format all dates using {{$context.$variables.DateFormat}} date format."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Get Panel Name",
            "returnType": "string",
            "sourceCode": "let panelName = $context.$app.$OraPanelName;\n\nreturn ($context.$app.$OraPanelName != \"panel-draft-negotiations\" && $context.$app.$OraPanelName != \"panel-pending-award-negotiations\" &&  $context.$app.$OraPanelName != \"panel-active-negotiations\")?'panel-workload':$context.$app.$OraPanelName;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1769837404670"
          },
          "code": "GET_PANEL_NAME",
          "id": "1769837306191",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"output\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Panel Requesting Data"
